ed the Clean Industrial Deal and thinking", "function": null}, {"name": "behind it.", "function": null}, {"name": "MEPs representing EPP, S&D, Renew, Greens took part in the", "function": null}, {"name": "debate and put forward questions inter alia on 2040 climate", "function": null}, {"name": "target, electricity market regulation, energy prices, ETS2, grid", "function": null}, {"name": "investments, resilience of energy infrastructure, public funding", "function": null}, {"name": "and EU forthcoming multiannual budget.", "function": null}, {"name": "EVP Ribera stressed the need to provide investment certainty and", "function": null}, {"name": "long-term perspective for business.", "function": null}, {"name": "Conclusions: N/A", "function": null}]}

